{
  "summary": "The experiment tested an RNA-only model using pca_n2000 encoder for singleprofile tasks, comparing it to the multimodal baseline (config_016) with validation accuracy 0.5266. The RNA-only model achieved lower validation accuracy (0.4849) and F1 (0.4639), suggesting multimodal integration may provide performance benefits. Uncertainty remains about the specific contribution of image data versus encoder choices, as no other single-modality baselines were directly compared."
}

